# AWS ECS/Fargate deployment

This Terraform root creates the ECS cluster, task and execution roles, scoped
secret access, Fargate task/service, CloudWatch logs, security groups, and an
HTTPS Application Load Balancer. Supply an immutable container image, existing
VPC/subnets, ACM certificate, and three Secrets Manager ARNs.

The selected `{{.Recipe.Database.Authority}}` authority is external. Put its connection
URL in the supplied database secret; a managed database instance is not
silently provisioned into an unknown network.

Review, then run `terraform init`, `terraform plan`, and `terraform apply` from
this directory. Generation itself never applies infrastructure.
